    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A detected temporal conflict between two snapshot versions.</para>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_conflict_1af766742332249750a77346d6a7c01389" kindref="member">table_name</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_conflict_1a9c106b8de6559d6756cd0936d8c4d05a" kindref="member">entity_id</ref></computeroutput> together identify what conflicted:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_conflict_1af766742332249750a77346d6a7c01389" kindref="member">table_name</ref></computeroutput> is the table passed to detectConflicts().</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_conflict_1a9c106b8de6559d6756cd0936d8c4d05a" kindref="member">entity_id</ref></computeroutput> is the snapshot_id of the local snapshot (set by detectConflicts()).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Version identity is preserved in <computeroutput>local_version.snapshot_id</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>remote_version.snapshot_id</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
